Package: sszvz
Title: Package to read data, wrangle, analyse and plot data on Verkehrszählungen from the city of Zurich
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person("Sara",
      "Hänzi",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "sara.haenzi@zuerich.ch"),
    person("Statistik Stadt Zürich",
      email = "statistik@zuerich.ch",
      role = c("cph", "fnd")
    ))
Description: The package provides functions to read parquet files on the counts of cars and bikes at various points in the city of Zurich; other functions then wrangle, aggregate and plot these data.
